        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'ulooda gheaboonyanga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rukusiina fuga Israeli gweaneey nagheeda miy bea geeta simwanmwan bea saytuunajeega bea gheaboong'nyeanda, ak abeeda ghwayeat gheaboonyaneeda ea mamusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwayiin Haruni badayda weasta beashooda aheen sandakwajeanda neajeeda, sea maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ak gayghwanung' ghwayeat ghang'eada shing'ada ea ghwahita sakteayda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA; nih gayghoah deaweeda damanda manda muudeanooda aba jeeda seaygoojigaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwanung'waada ghwayeat gheaboonyanga aba heeda siyiina gheaboonyanga sisna dahaabooda miyaasiin aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mukaateeyda siitaw ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Geani giloohaji diktam ea ang'wan bea dearanga miyaasiin ak giiwaali mukaataji damaniyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaynung' gwasin ghealooni iyeenya, nea gweata fih lah aba giliwas ghaalu, aba badayda measeeda miy sisna dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajiina geediga ng'andidi muuchi giliwas ghaalu, ak goodeayi sea mukaate ghoah gida jea eapkaat jea eatayda sighwarda bea NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giliwas eaweeda sabaato gayghoayeat Haruni aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghwanung'waada ghwayeat aba badahuuka fuga Israeli ak ghoah neajeeda damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygaba Haruni sea orjoagaaschi, ak gayghwaak aba heeda ghaydit, aba gideaba aba headaanyi gidaghaydit muuchi gil aba haleanjeeda sighadoawanda sighwarda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, aba diigheanda manda muudeanooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidasiiteaschi doobiiwnata sea ghoorjooda hit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu orjeeda gatmooni was Israelajeanda, was ghwaan siida Misri, ghang'eat gwaneayeewa jeeda fuga Israeli; ak ghwajal orjeeda gatmooda was Israelajeanda sea siispa Israeli aba jeeda mujiini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean goong'eawi orjeeda was ghaamwat Israelajeanda gheawunga ASEETA nea ghamwaashta. Ak geeyaat heeda Musa. Nea gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Shelomiti, was hudeaba Dibri, bea dooshta Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geayiin ghealooniga, ea eaghus ea sirukusa saawa gidagasa NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aruunana jeeda gheeda siidida mooriidean; ak abeeda ghwayiin buuneesean niyiiy geatinga nyaawa uhuudaanyi, ak abeeda geanung' gafuta lagheanga buuneesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giyeeshi fuga Israeli, Siida wassean mwaashta ASEATAANYI gayghwanyas riing'eadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siidida ang'eawi gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA gajeenuus; gaygafu eemeesean niny; siida was rabascheanda ea siideaba ng'eang'i, iyang'eawi Gheawunga ASEETA gajeenuus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida nuus siida gajeenuus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida bwar diyeayda gayghoaghiis, eaweega aba eaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu siida nung' gwasin giischeewoocheandaanyi badeeda, gidida sin ninyiin gajeesima niny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "giinyooda ea giinyooda, gheang'da ea gheang'da, geeshadeeda ea geeshadeeda; gawuurji gidasisinda siida badeeda, gajeesissa niny badeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida bwar diyeayda gayghoaghiis; nea siida nuus siida gajeenuus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajoondeawana deaweedeanagi aba rabascheanda ea siideaba ng'eang'i; aba gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobalool Musa fuga Israeli ak geeyeadu siidida mwaashtaan eeruuna jeeda gheeda, ak geefuta lagheanga. Hean gwasinda fuga Israeli gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
